<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Samrand half yr headline shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Samrand half yr headline shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		 2.5	  vs   1.4</p>
<p>    - attrib		   2.5	  vs   1.4</p>
<p>    Retained income	  3.39	 vs   1.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    2.32	 vs   1.90</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.004	vs   0.15</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.35	 vs   0.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		  14.22	 vs   7.08</p>
<p>Full name: Samrand Development Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected to continue the trend of satisfactory organic growth for the remainder of the current year.</p>
